ing?** — O que ele vestia?","**Did you see his face?** — Viu o rosto?","**No, I wasn’t looking at him.** — Não, eu não o olhava.","**To be honest…** — Para ser honesto…","**Frankly speaking…** — Falando francamente…","**In my opinion…** — Na minha opinião…","**As far as I know…** — Até onde sei…"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"draw","pt":"desenhar","forms":[["I / you / we / they draw","I draw flowers."],["he / she / it draws","She draws well."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Witness","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Witness","lines":[["Officer","What was he wearing?","O que ele vestia?"],["Witness","A red jacket. I was looking at the bag.","Uma jaqueta vermelha. Eu olhava a bolsa."],["Officer","Did you see his face?","Viu o rosto?"],["Witness","No, I wasn’t looking at him.","Não, eu não o olhava."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Entonação de perguntas e pedidos educados","items":[{"label":"Entonação de perguntas e pedidos educados","note":"Pratique em voz alta.","words":[]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Describe a past scene with while.","pt":"Descreva.","model":"While I was walking, it started to rain."},{"q":"Say what was happening when something stopped.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I was cooking when the lights went out."},{"q":"Ask: What was he wearing?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"What was he wearing?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences mixing Past Simple and Continuous.","model":"While I was walking, it started to rain. I was cooking when the phone rang. They were watching TV when the lights went out. She wasn’t looking. A man stole a bag.","checklist":["Usei **while/when**","Usei **contínuo + simples**","Frases claras"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “witness” mean?","opts":["memória","testemunha","roubar"],"ans":1,"why":"**witness** = testemunha."},{"q":"What does “memory” mean?","opts":["experimento","ladrão","memória"],"ans":2,"why":"**memory** = memória."},{"q":"What does “experiment” mean?","opts":["experimento","roubar","detalhe"],"ans":0,"why":"**experiment** = experimento."},{"q":"What does “steal” mean?","opts":["ladrão","roubar","errado"],"ans":1,"why":"**steal** = roubar."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Treine esta habilidade com o formato de tarefas curtas das provas (TOEFL/IELTS).","Leia o enunciado primeiro e procure as palavras-chave."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Use exemplos reais da vida dos alunos e peça frases próprias.","Corrija o erro mais frequente da aula em grupo, sem expor o aluno.","Retome o conteúdo na aula seguinte com um exercício curto."]}]}]}